/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:80:def _is_diamond8(comp: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> bool:
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:107:    Swap the diamond color and the ray color around each diamond while keeping the same ray geometry.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:111:    - Each object contains an 8-cell hollow diamond in one non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:112:    - Each occupied diamond edge has a short adjacent diagonal outer segment in a second non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:115:    - Recover each diamond and each adjacent outer segment exactly as in the base task.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/12/code.py:116:    - For one diamond, treat the shared outer-segment color as the swap target for the diamond outline.
